## Live synthesis, mp3, free-tier model
curl -s -o live-synthesis-sr-free-tier.mp3 -w "HTTP_STATUS:%{http_code}\n" \
  -X POST "https://api.fish.audio/v1/tts" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer <FISH_API_KEY>" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "model: s2.1-pro-free" \
  -d '{"text":"Zdravo, ovo je test.","reference_id":"2ad62aaf885e4a14add09fe4a38ffd23","format":"mp3"}'
